# Agentic Framework

This repo uses the `.agentic/` development framework. Read first: AGENTS.md (if present), CONTEXT_PACK.md, .agentic/STATUS.md, .agentic/spec/*

## Workflow

All work is managed by `ag` commands. Never skip steps.

- `ag start F-XXXX "Title"` — begin feature | `ag status` — current work | `ag info F-XXXX` — details
- `ag transition F-XXXX <state>` | `ag check F-XXXX` | `ag verify F-XXXX` | `ag done F-XXXX`
- `ag commit` | `ag merge <pr#> [F-XXXX]` | `ag flush` | `ag backlog` | `ag todo`
- `ag phase list F-XXXX` | `ag phase done F-XXXX <id>` | `ag auto task|epic|verify|crunch`
- `ag intel remember "..." --context "..."` | `ag intel architecture|spec|implement|test [F-XXXX]`

Artifacts go to `.agentic/work/F-XXXX/`: plan.md, spec.md, review.md, journal.md, verification.json.

## Trigger Words

| User intent | Action |
|-------------|--------|
| Build / implement / add / create | `ag start F-XXXX "Title"`, plan, then implement |
| Large (>10 files) | TOO BIG. Break into 3-5 smaller tasks |
| Fix / debug / troubleshoot | Write failing test FIRST |
| Commit / push / ship | `ag commit` |
| Done / complete / merged | `ag done F-XXXX` |
| Idea / remember / todo | `ag todo "description"` |
| Backlog / what's next | `ag backlog` |
| Spec / contract / AC | `ag spec F-XXXX` or `ag contract check F-XXXX` |
| Decompose / break down | `ag decompose F-XXXX` |
| Batch / churn / all tasks | `ag auto crunch` (NEVER multi-feature code outside ag auto) |
| User correction / preference | `ag intel remember "..." --context "..."` |

## Rules

- Never auto-commit in interactive sessions. Show changes to human first.
- PR by default (check `git_workflow` in STACK.md).
- Add/update tests for new/changed logic. Write tests alongside code.
- Spec + code + tests + docs = done.
- Keep changes small (max 5-10 files per commit).
- No feature inflation: improvements to existing features stay on those features.

## Token-Efficient Scripts (use these, never edit state files directly)

- `bash .agentic/lib/tools/status.sh focus "Task"` → STATUS.md
- `bash .agentic/lib/tools/journal.sh "Topic" "Outcomes" "Next" "Blockers" --why "Problem"` → JOURNAL.md
- `bash .agentic/lib/tools/blocker.sh add "Title" "type" "Details"` → HUMAN_NEEDED.md
- `bash .agentic/lib/tools/feature.sh cap add "Name" "Description"` → FEATURES.md
- `ag todo "Idea"` → TODO.md
